From d11d0332abe3dd4613a173523b8b26442ce051a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cheng Fangming <chengfangming1993@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 15:54:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] media: iris: harden session reuse and legacy seeks

Close stopped HFI sessions and release their internal DMA so retained V4L2 file handles do not consume firmware slots, memory, or power votes.

On legacy VPU5 decoders, detect large input timestamp discontinuities, recycle corrupt and stale capture frames, and hold one normal output frame long enough to reject a late old-epoch frame during an in-place userspace seek.
---
